<view class="page list-page">
  <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="preview-banner">开发预览 · 合成演示数据，非真实员工记录</view>
  <view class="eyebrow">BOOMER / WORK · LEARN</view><view class="page-title">{{title}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'objectives'}}" class="notice">门店工作协作目标；营业额不计入知识考试、员工考核或处罚。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'vouchers'}}" class="notice">这里展示当前门店的优惠券模板，不是顾客已领取的个人券包。顾客出示兑换码后，先查询核对，再确认核销。<button class="button-secondary" data-url="/pages/voucher/index" bindtap="go">扫码核销</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'community'}}" class="notice">从自己的知识库选择已保存商品，在商品详情中分享到 BOOMER 圈。<button class="button-secondary" data-url="/pages/list/index?kind=my-library" bindtap="go">选择商品分享</button></view>
  <button wx:if="{{kind === 'conversations'}}" class="button-secondary" data-url="/pages/detail/index?kind=conversation" bindtap="go">新建 BOOMER 助手对话</button>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'check-ins'}}" class="notice">每日成长签到不是考勤，不用于出勤判断。日期以服务器的中国时区为准。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{checkin}}" class="card checkin-card"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">{{checkin.date}}</view><text class="chip">{{checkin.checkedToday ? '今日已成长签到' : '今日未成长签到'}}</text></view><view class="row checkin-stats"><view><view class="muted">连续天数</view><view class="checkin-number">{{checkin.currentStreak}}</view></view><view><view class="muted">最长连续</view><view class="checkin-number">{{checkin.longestStreak}}</view></view><view><view class="muted">累计天数</view><view class="checkin-number">{{checkin.total}}</view></view></view><button class="button" bindtap="submitCheckin" disabled="{{checkingIn || loading || checkin.checkedToday}}" loading="{{checkingIn}}">{{checkin.checkedToday ? '云端已确认今日成长签到' : '每日成长签到'}}</button><view wx:if="{{checkinNotice}}" class="notice">{{checkinNotice}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'tasks'}}" class="notice">每日任务与待领经验均以云端状态为准。完成条件、奖励资格和领取结果由服务器核验。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'tasks' && rewardSummary}}" class="card reward-card">
    <view class="row reward-heading"><view class="section-title">当前已加载奖励</view><text class="chip">{{rewardSummary.date}}</text></view>
    <view class="reward-counts">待领事件 {{rewardSummary.pendingCount}} 项 · 每日达标 {{rewardSummary.dailyCount}} 项</view>
    <view class="muted reward-help">只读取本人最新最多 50 条待领事件及 4 条每日任务，不代表全部历史。本页已提交项目不重复加入队列。</view>
    <button class="button reward-action" bindtap="confirmRewards" loading="{{rewardBusy}}" disabled="{{preview || rewardBusy || rewardModal || loading || rewardNeedsRefresh || !rewardCanClaim}}">{{rewardBusy ? '正在逐项核对领取…' : '领取当前已加载奖励'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="muted reward-help">开发预览只展示合成内容，不能领取真实经验。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'tasks' && rewardOutcomes.length}}" class="card reward-results">
    <view class="row reward-heading"><view class="section-title">本次逐项结果</view><text class="muted">{{rewardProgress}}</text></view>
    <view class="reward-total">已确认经验变动 <text>{{rewardTotalText}}</text></view>
    <view class="muted reward-help">确认时服务器日期 {{rewardBatchDate}}。回包不含领取日期，不能保证跨日仍属该日；本次不是原子批次。</view>
    <view class="reward-counts">已确认 {{rewardCounts.confirmed}} · 拒绝 {{rewardCounts.rejected}} · 未确认 {{rewardCounts.unknown}} · 未提交 {{rewardCounts.untouched}}</view>
    <view wx:for="{{rewardOutcomes}}" wx:key="key" class="reward-outcome {{item.status}}"><view class="reward-item-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="row reward-item-result"><text>{{item.statusText}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.status === 'confirmed'}}">{{item.amountText}} 经验</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.dateUnverified}}" class="muted reward-help">日期跨界，服务端领取日期未核验</view></view>
    <view class="muted reward-help">拒绝不算新增奖励，也不代表从未领取。未确认项目不会自动重试；列表窗口移动或条目消失不能证明本次领取成功。</view>
    <button class="button-secondary reward-action" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{rewardBusy || loading}}">只读刷新云端状态</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'tasks' && rewardNotice}}" class="notice reward-notice">{{rewardNotice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind === 'tasks' && rewardRefreshError}}" class="card error"><view>{{rewardRefreshError}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{kind !== 'check-ins' && kind !== 'tasks'}}" class="search-box row"><input maxlength="{{isOfficial ? -1 : 140}}" placeholder="{{isOfficial ? '搜索官方知识，最多80字' : ((isLearningCollection || isHistoryCollection) ? '搜索已加载内容' : '搜索当前内容')}}" value="{{query}}" bindinput="onSearchInput" bindconfirm="onSearch" confirm-type="search" /><button bindtap="onSearch">搜索</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{isLearningCollection && kind !== 'quiz-history'}}" class="row mastery-tabs">
    <button class="mastery-tab {{mastery === 'all' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mastery="all" bindtap="onMastery">全部已加载</button>
    <button class="mastery-tab {{mastery === 'pending' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mastery="pending" bindtap="onMastery">待掌握</button>
    <button class="mastery-tab {{mastery === 'mastered' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-mastery="mastered" bindtap="onMastery">已掌握</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{loadedSummary}}" class="learning-summary"><view>{{loadedSummary}}</view><view class="muted">{{pagingNote}}</view></view>
  <picker wx:if="{{isOfficial}}" class="official-category-picker" range="{{officialCategoryOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{officialCategoryIndex}}" bindtap="beginOfficialCategory" bindchange="onOfficialCategory" disabled="{{loading || loadingMore || error}}"><view class="official-category-field"><view class="muted official-category-caption">官方知识分类</view><view class="row official-category-value"><text>{{officialCategoryLabel}}</text><text class="official-category-control">选择 ›</text></view></view></picker>
  <picker wx:if="{{isOfficial && (category || officialIPLabel !== '全部细分')}}" range="{{officialIPOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{officialIPIndex}}" bindtap="beginOfficialIP" bindchange="onOfficialIP" disabled="{{loading || error}}"><view class="official-category-field"><view class="muted official-category-caption">IP / 细分</view><view class="row official-category-value"><text>{{officialIPLabel}}</text><text class="official-category-control">选择 ›</text></view></view></picker>
  <view wx:if="{{isOfficial && !category}}" class="row official-sorts"><button class="{{officialRequestedSort === 'latest' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-sort="latest" data-request="{{officialRequest}}" bindtap="onOfficialSort" disabled="{{loading || error}}">最近更新</button><button class="{{officialRequestedSort === 'hot' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-sort="hot" data-request="{{officialRequest}}" bindtap="onOfficialSort" disabled="{{loading || error}}">窗口内热度</button><button class="{{officialRequestedSort === 'important' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-sort="important" data-request="{{officialRequest}}" bindtap="onOfficialSort" disabled="{{loading || error}}">重要度</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{isOfficial && (officialEra || officialOrigin)}}" class="official-chips"><button wx:if="{{officialEra}}" class="chip" data-field="era" data-request="{{officialRequest}}" bindtap="onOfficialClear" disabled="{{loading || error}}">年代：{{officialEra}} ×</button><button wx:if="{{officialOrigin}}" class="chip" data-field="origin" data-request="{{officialRequest}}" bindtap="onOfficialClear" disabled="{{loading || error}}">产地：{{officialOrigin}} ×</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{isOfficial && officialWindowNote}}" class="muted official-window-note">{{officialWindowNote}}</view>
  <scroll-view wx:if="{{!isOfficial && kind !== 'knowledge' && categories.length}}" scroll-x class="category-scroll">
    <button class="chip category {{category === '' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="" bindtap="onCategory">全部</button>
    <button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="chip category {{category === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onCategory">{{item.name}}</button>
  </scroll-view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card loading-state">正在获取云端内容…</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error"><text>{{error}}</text><button class="button-secondary" bindtap="retry">重试加载</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !items.length}}" class="card empty"><view class="empty-symbol">录</view><view>{{isLearningCollection || isHistoryCollection ? '当前筛选暂无内容' : '暂无记录'}}</view><view class="muted">{{(isLearningCollection || isHistoryCollection) && hasMore ? '已加载内容中暂未找到匹配项，可继续加载下一页。' : '没有记录不等于任务已完成，也不代表接口错误。'}}</view></view>
  <block wx:for="{{learningGroups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="category">
    <view class="row library-group-heading"><text>{{group.label}}</text><text class="muted">当前已加载 {{group.count}} 条</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:key="id" class="card entry" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openItem" hover-class="pressed">
      <image wx:if="{{item.cover_url}}" class="entry-image" src="{{item.cover_url}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="entry-main"><view class="row library-source-row"><text class="chip">{{item.sourceBadge}}</text><text class="score">{{item.passedText}}</text></view><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.body}}" class="muted summary">{{item.body}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.passedAt}}" class="muted learning-date">通过时间 {{item.passedAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.lastAttemptAt}}" class="muted learning-date">最近作答 {{item.lastAttemptAt}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.sourceNotice}}" class="muted learning-date">{{item.sourceNotice}}</view><view class="row entry-footer"><text class="muted">{{item.time}}</text><text class="arrow">查看 →</text></view></view>
    </view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{!learningGroups.length}}">
  <view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card entry" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openItem" hover-class="pressed">
    <image wx:if="{{item.cover_url}}" class="entry-image" src="{{item.cover_url}}" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="entry-main"><view class="row entry-meta"><text class="chip">{{item.categoryLabel || item.category || title}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.body}}" class="muted summary">{{item.body}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.progress !== null}}" class="progress">云端进度 {{item.progress}}<text wx:if="{{item.target !== null}}"> / {{item.target}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{isOfficial && (item.ipName || item.era || item.origin)}}" class="muted official-row-metadata"><text wx:if="{{item.ipName}}">{{item.ipName}} </text><text wx:if="{{item.era}}">{{item.era}} </text><text wx:if="{{item.origin}}">{{item.origin}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.amount !== null}}" class="progress">奖励经验 {{item.amount}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.scoreText || item.passedText}}" class="score">{{item.passedText}}<text wx:if="{{item.scoreText}}"> · {{item.scoreText}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.passedAt}}" class="muted learning-date">通过时间 {{item.passedAt}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.lastAttemptAt}}" class="muted learning-date">最近作答 {{item.lastAttemptAt}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.sourceNotice}}" class="muted learning-date">{{item.sourceNotice}}</view>
      <view class="row entry-footer"><text wx:if="{{kind !== 'quiz-history'}}" class="muted">{{item.time}}</text><text class="arrow">查看 →</text></view></view>
  </view>
  </block>
  <button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="button-secondary" loading="{{loadingMore}}" disabled="{{loadingMore}}" bindtap="loadMore">加载更多</button>
  <view wx:if="{{freshness}}" class="muted freshness">{{freshness}}</view>
</view>
